A navigation bar linking every policy and governance page on the wiki — rules, privacy, licensing, the EDP, requirements, romanization, adminship requests, the admin noticeboard and block appeals.

Place it at the top or bottom of any policy page so readers can move between them. Takes no parameters.

==Syntax==
{{T|Policy navbox}}

To add a page to the bar, edit this template directly — the link list is hardcoded.